<title>SWEDEN: Swedish unemployment steady at 8.8 pct in Feb.</title>
<headline>Swedish unemployment steady at 8.8 pct in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unemployment in Sweden was 8.8 percent in February, unchanged from a month earlier, Statistics Sweden said on Friday.  </p>
<p> SWEDISH UNEMPLOYMENT	 Feb 97     Jan 97	Feb 96</p>
<p> Percent of workforce	 8.8	   8.8	  7.7</p>
<p> Number of unemployed	 372,000     375,000    327,000</p>
<p>NOTE - Market players expected unemployment to fall to 8.4 percent in February, a Reuters poll of 14 analysts showed. -- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
